pass in quick on jo0123456789a0a inet6 proto icmp6 from { 2001:db8:1::100, fe80::/10 } to ff02::/16 icmp6-type { listenrep, listendone, 143 } label "jo-5cea6361e9d9" keep state (if-bound)
pass in quick on jo0123456789a0a inet6 proto icmp6 from { 2001:db8:1::100, fe80::/10 } to any icmp6-type { unreach, toobig, timex, paramprob } label "jo-63bf56ab5486" keep state (if-bound)
block out quick on jo0123456789a0a inet6 proto icmp6 from any to any icmp6-type { redir, routeradv }
